Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:50:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-5: data fields -- control <-> [section] key <->
 the C++ / BCB6 lines that read and write it (0.5.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- the wire scripts' field maps (2,504 rows): hand-written
  XST1: ['Hotplate Form', 'X Start'(, note)] and generated (HT9045Wire.register)
  XST1: ['hotPlate', 'Hotplate Form', 'X Start'] = [doc, section, key]
- panel section 資料欄位: XST1 -> [Hotplate Form] X Start -> port
  HotPlateForm_File.cpp:386 write, fHotPlate.cpp:218 read; BCB6 cHotPlate.cpp:598
  write, :164 read. Lines that name both section and key first; key-only is
  marked weak (the section may be a variable)
- CodeLens above C++ / BCB6 ("Hotplate Form", "X Start") pairs: 網頁欄位 ... ›
  XST1, click -> designer with the control selected; a control mapped by both
  wire files counts once; pages are only those that really have the control

Tests: lib 61 / probe 2 pages / fake vscode 37 / real VS Code 40 incl.
8-page sweep -- all pass, 12 opened files byte-identical (MD5).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
